; The root of the mini Internet of the `recurse` modes (compare.sh): one TLD, delegated with glue, signed for
; `recurse-dnssec` (its DS comes from the TLD's key, which compare.py generates first). Rendered by compare.py.
$ORIGIN .
$TTL 3600
@               SOA   a.root. hostmaster.root. 1 3600 900 604800 3600
@               NS    a.root.
a.root.         A     127.0.0.2
bench.          NS    ns.nic.bench.
ns.nic.bench.   A     127.0.0.3
#@dnssec bench.          DS    @DS@
